  {"date": "2015-07-21", "venue": "Les Schwab Amphitheater", "city": "Bend", "state": "OR", "gap": 1682, "set": "1", "jamchart": true, "jam": "Debut. It's clear the band couldn't wait to play \"Blaze On\", hinting at its improvisational prowess from the get-go during the first set of tour.", "note": "Debut.", "prev": "Devotion to a Dream", "next": "Tube", "nb": 1},
